{
  "meta": {
    "package": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC_INT.pcc",
    "stem": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC",
    "textLang": "INT",
    "sets": 3
  },
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_amb_negotiator_D|136698",
      "en": "Pardon me, soldier. Could I take a moment of your time?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136699",
      "en": "Soldier, I've got a major situation, and I need help from somebody with humanity's interests at heart.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136700",
      "en": "Of course. Right to business. That's why humanity has the best damn fleet in the galaxy.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136701",
      "en": "My name is Elias Keeler. I'm an Alliance negotiator. We've got a big session coming up with the salarians. ",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136702",
      "en": "You wouldn't believe what's riding on this. I'm fighting for humanity on this one, just like you are!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136703",
      "en": "I'm not on the front lines, but I'm making sure our jobs don't get outsourced to the aliens.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136704",
      "en": "I need every edge I can get. Specifically, I need a certain mental stimulant.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136705",
      "en": "In order to do my best for humanity, I need the best resources on the market.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136706",
      "en": "There's a mental stimulant that increases alertness and cognitive function.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136707",
      "en": "I need you to buy a mental stimulant for me. ",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136708",
      "en": "It's legal but restricted. I've purchased the monthly limit, and I need more from the med bay.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136709",
      "en": "The salarians want to set up long-term trade agreements. There are billions of credits at stake.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136710",
      "en": "If I don't get the drug, my assistant will take over and mess up the whole deal. It would be a disaster.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136711",
      "en": "I don't know the medical terms, but it increases mental capacity, short-term recall, that sort of thing.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136713",
      "en": "The negotiations were supposed to be last week, but the salarians stalled it, probably deliberately.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136714",
      "en": "If I don't get the stimulant, I'll be a wreck. My assistant will take over, and that would be a disaster.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136715",
      "en": "I understand. I'll pay you back for it, and I can even throw in a little extra.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136716",
      "en": "Thanks for your help. Like I said, you can find the stimulant over in the med bay.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136717",
      "en": "What century are you living in? Do you think those salarians hesitate before amping themselves up?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136718",
      "en": "If you won't help me keep humanity strong, I'll find somebody else who will!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136719",
      "en": "Perfect. The salarians will never see me coming. Here. This is for your trouble.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136720",
      "en": "What is... this isn't the stimulant! What did you give me?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136721",
      "en": "It's commander, actually. What do you want?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136722",
      "en": "What kind of situation are we talking about?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136726",
      "en": "I don't remember seeing you hip-deep in geth back on Eden Prime.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136729",
      "en": "I understand. It's important. So what do you need?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136732",
      "en": "Don't try to sell me on this. Just tell me what you want.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136734",
      "en": "Why is this deal so important?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136736",
      "en": "What is this stimulant, exactly?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136738",
      "en": "If you know the monthly limits, why did you go over them?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136740",
      "en": "Is your assistant incompetent or just inexperienced?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136741",
      "en": "I'll see what I can do, but I can't guarantee anything.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136745",
      "en": "I'll get back to you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136746",
      "en": "Here's the drug you asked for.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136747",
      "en": "Here. This should take care of all your problems.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136748",
      "en": "I'm not just a soldier.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136749",
      "en": "What is it?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136750",
      "en": "I'm listening.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136753",
      "en": "You're a pencil-pusher.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136754",
      "en": "I get it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136755",
      "en": "Cut the act.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136761",
      "en": "The negotiation",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136762",
      "en": "The drug",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136763",
      "en": "Drug dosage",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136765",
      "en": "No promises.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136767",
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136768",
      "en": "(Give him the stimulant.)",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136769",
      "en": "(Give him the depressant.)",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136773",
      "en": "What's wrong with him?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136798",
      "en": "If you've gotten your temper back under control, I could still use help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136799",
      "en": "I tell you what: this will be the last time I use the stimulant. After this deal is finished, I'll get treatment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136800",
      "en": "You don't understand! Humanity needs me, and I need that stimulant! Without it, I'll...",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136801",
      "en": "I don't know anymore. I get so tired when I run out of the stimulant. I just need one more boost.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136802",
      "en": "You're right. I-- I'll go tell my assistant. I shouldn't be working like this.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136803",
      "en": "I'll get help. I'm just sorry it came to this.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136805",
      "en": "As we agreed, I'll get treatment when the deal is done. Thank you for your help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136806",
      "en": "Thanks for your help. I won't trouble you again.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136807",
      "en": "You bastard... You... set me up...",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136808",
      "en": "Alien... loving... scum...",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136809",
      "en": "Any luck getting what I asked for?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136810",
      "en": "It helps me stay focused, and it keeps me sharp. Nothing gets by me when I'm on it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136811",
      "en": "Worse. He's an alien sympathizer.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136812",
      "en": "My assistant wants to bend over backwards for the Citadel races. He wants to show them we're reasonable!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136813",
      "en": "No race will respect us until we show them who's in charge! That's what it took with the turians. Forget my assistant.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136814",
      "en": "Like I already told you, after this deal is done, I'll get treatment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136815",
      "en": "It might look that way from the outside, but this is just a one-time slip-up.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136816",
      "en": "All the top negotiators are on stimulants close to the legal limit. It's the way the game is played.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136817",
      "en": "Maybe you're right. I've been trying to keep humanity strong, and maybe I've pushed myself too hard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136820",
      "en": "You should put some trust in your assistant. Didn't you train him?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136822",
      "en": "We need to talk about your drug addiction again.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136823",
      "en": "Keeler, you've got a problem. You need to get treatment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136825",
      "en": "Will overdosing on stimulants and getting arrested help humanity, Keeler?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136826",
      "en": "I don't see all the top negotiators soliciting help to go over the legal limit, Keeler.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136828",
      "en": "You won't be doing humanity any favors if you overdose during negotiations. Get help now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136829",
      "en": "No trade negotiation is worth ruining your life for. Let it go and get help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136831",
      "en": "There's no shame in having a problem, but you have to get treatment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136832",
      "en": "That sounds like an addict talking, Keeler. What does it take to convince you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136834",
      "en": "Getting you your drug fix isn't high on my list of priorities, Keeler.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136836",
      "en": "You're an addict and a bigot. Your assistant will do a better job. You need to get help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136837",
      "en": "This deal is too important to have a drug addict negotiating it. You need to get help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136838",
      "en": "Humanity doesn't need drug addicts negotiating important deals. Get some rest.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136841",
      "en": "Let's discuss your problem.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136842",
      "en": "You're an addict.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136843",
      "en": "I'm leaving.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136844",
      "en": "Have a little faith.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136845",
      "en": "Have a little faith.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136846",
      "en": "I'm sure it will be fine.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136849",
      "en": "I'll see what I can do.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136850",
      "en": "If you say so.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136852",
      "en": "If you say so.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136853",
      "en": "I'll see what I can do.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136854",
      "en": "Don't be an idiot.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136855",
      "en": "Then the game is wrong.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136857",
      "en": "I'll see what I can do.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136858",
      "en": "If you say so.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136859",
      "en": "No. You'll go now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136860",
      "en": "You need help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136862",
      "en": "You'll be okay.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136863",
      "en": "Get treatment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136864",
      "en": "Listen to yourself.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136867",
      "en": "I couldn't risk it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136868",
      "en": "Sorry, Keeler.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136869",
      "en": "I couldn't risk it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136870",
      "en": "Sorry, Keeler.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta20_negotiator_D|136871",
      "en": "A lesson.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|77276",
      "en": "Yeah, what is it?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81636",
      "en": "Doran didn't have a clue what I was doing. He assumed I was cheating.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81637",
      "en": "Either you're cheating or you're not.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81638",
      "en": "I was just tipping the scales in my favor. Only as an experiment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81640",
      "en": "To you, maybe. But this device is merely intended to simulate situations and record results.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81642",
      "en": "Recording losses is easy, of course. Nobody notices those.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81654",
      "en": "Mmh.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81655",
      "en": "Why were you tossed out of there?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81656",
      "en": "Seems the owner didn't like the way you played their games.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81659",
      "en": "It still sounds like cheating to me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81676",
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81677",
      "en": "What happened?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81678",
      "en": "You cheated?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81679",
      "en": "Nothing.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_07A_DSG_LOC|sta60_schells_D|81682",
      "en": "Explain.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
